  "name": "Holy Nova",
  "type": "spell",
  "img": "icons/svg/daze.svg",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You release a burst of holy energy in a 15-foot radius circle around you. All friendly creature regain 3d6 hit points, while all hostile creatures must make a Constitution saving throw, taking 4d6 radiant damage on a failed save or half as much on a success. Aberrations, fiends, undead make this saving throw with disadvantage.</p><p><strong>At Higher Level.</strong> When you cast this spell with a spell slot of 4th level or higher, The healing and damage done increases by 1d6 for each slot level above 3rd.</p>",
